                                                "sense_id": "83129928-94aa-3248-be04-841da47ae135",
                                                "text": "\"I see I must bribe you to harbour me—come, pledge me in a bumper health to the last young lady that slept at Wolf's Crag, and liked her quarters.—My bones are not so tender as hers, and I am resolved to occupy her apartment tonight, that I may judge how hard the couch is that love can soften.\""
